			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@stubbornella\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>stubbornella</span></a></span> there’s a whole <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/webComponentsCG\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>webComponentsCG</span></a> with all the best ideas for making <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/webComponents\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>webComponents</span></a> even better than they are today, we’d love to chat! 👋🏽</p>",
